<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000045> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A material entity which is clinically abnormal and part of an extended organism. Disorders are the physical basis of disease." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000045> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "review target in BBO from disease_terms_review_enriched.csv" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000045> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000045> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "disorder" .
